      <activity id="a3d4b288-a3fd-5989-b0cc-f28fc00d0abb" activityNameId="3107eedf-26a5-52b8-a7d0-7842fbb4077c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 300, profile 2</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 300, profile 2
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 3c56d872-a151-486a-ad1e-9e0cdc4dbe07
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe, DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with polymer concrete pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. Polymer concrete pipe, ID 300 mm, outer diameter 366 mm, wall thickness 33 mm, 79 kg/m, 2300 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c56d872-a151-486a-ad1e-9e0cdc4dbe07.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
