        <unitName xml:lang="en">meter</unitName>
        <comment xml:lang="en">Full flow name: Disposal, sewer system, polymer concrete pipe, DN 300, profile 2
(2,2,1,1,3,2,BU:3); Deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with polymer concrete pipe. DN 300, profile 2 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4).; Amount of construction materials being deconstructed based on process for similar sewer system typ, stages A1-A5, and according to SIA 190 as well as competence centre (cc) Kanalisation, VSA Arbeitsgruppe Materialwahl. Transport distances representing estimated average distances in Switzerland. Deconstruction and use of building machines based on "Maschinenstunden" (Machine hours) standard analysis in the TB-Viewer of the Schweizerischer Baumeisterverband (Swiss Contractors Association) 
BAFU mapping audit: {"bafu source exchange index": 2}</comment>
